WEBVTT

00:03:29.639 --> 00:03:32.208
Pathos is neither inherently good nor bad,

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:35.309
but it may be irrational 
and unpredictable.

00:03:35.309 --> 00:03:37.868
It can just as easily rally 
people for peace

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:40.259
as incite them to war.

00:03:40.259 --> 00:03:41.703
Most advertising,

00:03:41.703 --> 00:03:45.609
from beauty products that promise
to relieve our physical insecurities

00:03:45.609 --> 00:03:47.919
to cars that make us feel powerful,

00:03:47.919 --> 00:03:50.419
relies on pathos.

00:03:50.419 --> 00:03:54.728
Aristotle's rhetorical appeals 
still remain powerful tools today,

00:03:54.728 --> 00:03:56.799
but deciding which of them to use

00:03:56.799 --> 00:03:59.372
is a matter of knowing 
your audience and purpose,

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:01.629
as well as the right place and time.